947cd4a3d8e735d3d"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d196\"},\"ref\":\"d196\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cristina Yang from Grey's Anatomy\\n\\n4. Buffy Summers from Buffy the Vampire Slayer\\n\\n5. Olivia Pope from Scandal\\n\\n6. Rosa Diaz from Brooklyn Nine-Nine\\n\\n7. Callie Torres from Grey's Anatomy\\n\\n8. Kate Pearson from This Is Us\\n\\n9. Jane Villanueva from Jane the Virgin\\n\\n10 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/noradominick/female-tv-characters-that-inspire-us\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d188\"},\"ref\":\"d188\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2005, they won a Tony Award for their role in Spamalot, and joined Grey's shortly after.\\n\\nNow: Ramírez left Grey's after season 12, having played Dr. Callie Torres for a whopping 239 episodes. In addition to voicing Queen Miranda on the Disney animated series Sofia ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/gallery/greys-anatomy-cast-before-they-were-stars/?srsltid=AfmBOop9veMvemNQBxOptWObS-iC49SGiFhqZjNBzk87cYVuzqnbjT2L\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d197\"},\"ref\":\"d197\",\"snippet\":\" ... The couple married in 2012 and have since built a family together, welcoming three children. Stoudemire's journey from a high-profile dating scene to a stable family life reflects the personal growth and transitions many athletes experience off the court. His marriage to Welch marks a new ... \",\"title\":\"https://bolavip.com/en/sports/pro-athletes-who-dated-siblings-of-other-pro-athletes-or-coaches-daughters-2\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_se