. In \"The Vampire Diaries,\" there were real-life relatives. Let me also consider \"Jane the Virgin\" where the actress's real-life relative appeared. Actually, the most famous case is in telenovelas. Let me search more specifically.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Vampire Diaries character married multiple times one child survives\", \"Vampire Diaries cast real life relatives same show unrelated characters\", \"Vampire Diaries actor real life sister brother plays different character\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_c494fb53740748ad8d16683f","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Jane the Virgin Xiomara marriages children\", \"Jane the Virgin cast real life relatives\", \"Jane the Virgin actress height 1.68\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_c3ed10c565734cd89cc94eaf","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d203\"},\"ref\":\"d203\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nRomero was married three times. He married his first wife, Nancy, in 1971. They divorced in 1978. They had one child together, Cameron, who later became a filmmaker. \\n\\nRomero met his second wife, actress Christine Forrest, on the set of Season of the Witch (1972), and ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_A._Romero\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d204\"},\"ref\":\"d204\",\"snippet\":\" ... Smith\\n\\nYour comment has not been saved\\n\\nThe Vampire Diaries\\n\\n- Release Date\\n\\n- 2009 - 2017-00-00\\n\\n- Network\\n\\n- The CW\\n\\n- Showrunner\\n\\n- Julie Plec\\n\\nCast\\n\\n-\\n\\nPaul WesleyStefan Salvator